---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config/site';
---
<PageLayout title="Disclaimer" description={`${SITE_NAME} calculators provide estimates only and are not financial, tax or legal advice.`} path="/disclaimer/">
  <p><strong>Estimates only, not financial advice.</strong> The calculators and content on {SITE_NAME} are for general information and education. They are not financial, investment, tax, accounting or legal advice, and nothing here is a recommendation to buy, sell or borrow.</p>
  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>Results depend on the numbers you enter and on simplifying assumptions, which are listed on every calculator page. Actual outcomes differ: lenders round and charge fees, investment returns vary, and tax depends on your full circumstances. Tax slabs, rates and limits change; each tax calculator shows when its figures were last updated and where they come from, and some figures may be marked as not yet verified.</p>
  <h2>Investment returns</h2>
  <p>Projections such as SIP, lumpsum, compound interest and savings goal results assume a constant return. Real returns are uncertain and can be negative. Past performance does not guarantee future results.</p>
  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>Before making a financial decision, check the figures with your lender, employer, the official tax authority or a qualified professional. We accept no liability for losses arising from use of the site, to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>We link to official sources for reference. We do not control or endorse third-party websites.</p>
</PageLayout>
